-- akn:hc_1/p4 The page number written in by hand (1); no rule.

§§ `בדיקת הטבלה`

-- (1) The day and the rows: §4.1's day, seniority 1 to 36.
#ASSERT `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022 is updated from` EQUALS `the day §§4–5 apply the annex from` `annex א1 of the signed copy`
#ASSERT `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022`'s `published table from` EQUALS `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022 is updated from`
#ASSERT `the published labels of` `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022` EQUALS range 1 36

-- (2) The signed copy's annex א1, cell for cell: every cell here is that
-- annex's at the same seniority and grade, and the two print as many.
GIVEN l IS A NUMBER, g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the signed copy's annex א1 cell` l g IS
    `the signed-copy cell` (`the first table of` `annex א1 of the signed copy`) l g

#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published cells beside` `the signed copy's annex א1 cell` `in` `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022`))
#ASSERT `the published cells no rule reaches` `the signed copy's annex א1 cell` `in` `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022` EQUALS 0

`the cells the signed copy's annex א1 prints` MEANS
    count (concat (map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `signed-copy row amounts`) ((`the first table of` `annex א1 of the signed copy`)'s `signed-copy grid rows`)))

#ASSERT `the published cell count of` `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022` EQUALS `the cells the signed copy's annex א1 prints`

-- (3) The decision of 14.1.2025: its annex א1, printed to the agora,
-- governs from 1.9.2022 in this table's place. Every cell here is its cell
-- to the nearest shekel (convention rounding.half) save two, where the
-- decision prints an exact half shekel and this table takes it down — at
-- seniority 20, grade 7 (12,461.50) and seniority 31, grade 3
-- (10,410.50). Nothing turns on the two: the decision's
-- table is the one paid.
GIVEN l IS A NUMBER, g IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the decision's annex א1 cell to the shekel` l g IS
    CONSIDER `the signed-copy cell` (`the first table of` `annex א1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) l g
    WHEN JUST x THEN JUST (`to the nearest whole` x)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

`the cells of annex א'1 of 1.9.2022 off the decision's to the shekel` MEANS
    `the published misses in` (`the published cells beside` `the decision's annex א1 cell to the shekel` `in` `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022`)

GIVEN c IS A `published cell check`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the decision prints a half shekel where annex א'1 of 1.9.2022 rounds down` c IF
        c's `agorot over the rule` EQUALS (0 MINUS 100)
    AND CONSIDER `the signed-copy cell` (`the first table of` `annex א1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`) (c's `checked label`) (c's `checked grade`)
        WHEN JUST x THEN x MINUS FLOOR x EQUALS 0.5
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

#ASSERT map (GIVEN c YIELD LIST (c's `checked label`), (c's `checked grade`)) `the cells of annex א'1 of 1.9.2022 off the decision's to the shekel` EQUALS LIST (LIST 20, 7), (LIST 31, 3)
#ASSERT all `the decision prints a half shekel where annex א'1 of 1.9.2022 rounds down` `the cells of annex א'1 of 1.9.2022 off the decision's to the shekel`
#ASSERT `the published cells no rule reaches` `the decision's annex א1 cell to the shekel` `in` `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the annex as the decision of 14.1.2025 has it` `annex א1 of the signed copy` EQUALS `annex א1 of the decision of 14.1.2025`

-- (4) The steps it prints: 2% a year to the seventh year and 1% from the
-- eighth, 7.5% to every grade. Set beside the cell its step makes of its
-- neighbour to the nearest shekel, a cell of a table printed to the shekel
-- is at most a shekel off (each side is rounded once).
#ASSERT map (GIVEN s YIELD s's `published rate`) (`annex א'1 of 1.9.2022`'s `published grade rates`) EQUALS LIST (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%), (7.5%)
#ASSERT `the published worst miss in` (`the published cells beside` (`the published row rate of` `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022`) `in` `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022`) AT MOST 100
#ASSERT `the published worst miss in` (`the published cells beside` (`the published grade rate of` `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022`) `in` `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022`) AT MOST 100
#ASSERT `the published table rises along its grades and down its rows` `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022`

-- The table at work: the agreement's §4 on the signed copy and on the
-- decision's correction, beside this table.
#ASSERT `the published table pay on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022` 3 1 EQUALS `the table salary under §4 on` 1 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) 1 3 1
#ASSERT `the published table pay on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2022) `annex א'1 of 1.9.2022` 3 1 EQUALS NOTHING
